###Data
// The trading demo's rows, for demo::trading::DB where the browser runs it (runtime-duckdb.pure: DuckDB in the tab, or
// Python's): every app that opens the project fills a database of the project's own from them (C5, engine-client's
// project-data.ts). The server's H2 connection seeds the same rows itself (runtime-h2.pure), and the warehouse is made
// from these by the same planned load (query/demo/main.ts; its own SQL file, trading-seed.sql, deleted 2026-11-12).
